<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚负责，我会这样形容他。

00:58:30.140 --> 00:58:35.070
<v Mike Paterniti>His knuckles are dirty and scabbed. His breath smells of mash and lighter fluid.
<v Mike Paterniti>他的指关节又脏又结痂。他的呼吸里带着麦芽酒和打火机的味道。

00:58:35.070 --> 00:58:38.630
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回更多《美国生活》的故事。

00:58:38.630 --> 00:58:55.840
<v Mike Paterniti>Not friendly, but menacing.
<v Mike Paterniti>不友好，但带有威胁性。

00:58:55.840 --> 00:59:00.840
